  "r:\"Spend (\\d+) <link\\=(.+?)><u>Greenleaf</u></link> stacks for <color\\=#FFFC40>([\\d.]+)%</color> chance to inflict <link\\=(.+?)><u>Sleep</u></link> on 1 foe for (\\d+) turn\\. On success, increase foe's next attack damage taken by <color\\=#FFFC40>([\\d.]+)%</color> for (\\d+) turn\\. On failure, increase next damage taken by <color\\=#FFFC40>([\\d.]+)%</color> for (\\d+) turn\\.\\n<b><size\\=28><color\\=#850101>(.+?)</color></size></b>\"": "",
  "r:\"Highlight：Inflict <link\\=(.+?)><u>Sleep</u></link> on 1 foe for (\\d+) turn, and increase next damage taken by <color\\=#FFFC40>(.+?)%</color>\\.\\n1 MORE：Deal Psychokinesis damage to 1 foe\\.\\nMelee Attack：Deal Physical damage to 1 foe\\.\\nRanged Attack：Deal Gun damage to 1 foe\\. Can fire until out of ammo\\.\"": "",
  "r:\"After using a skill on an ally, increase target's damage by <color\\=#FFFC40>(.+?)%</color> for (\\d+) turns\\.\"": "",
  "r:\"Increase party's damage to foes with <link\\=(.+?)><u>spiritual ailments</u></link> by <color\\=#FFFC40>(.+?)%</color>\\.\"": "",
  "Seaside Tomoko can inflict <link\\=\"s|193\"><u>Sparks</u></link> on foes. After an ally acts, if foes have 3 Sparks stacks, activate Seaside Tomoko's <link\\=\"s|100\"><u>Resonance</u></link>: For every 3 Sparks stacks on all foes, deal Psy damage to all foes equal to 19% of Attack, and decrease the target's damage by 30% for 1 turn. Restore the party's HP by 9% of Seaside Tomoko's Attack + 300/600/900 (based on if she is at {{A}}. 1/50/70+, respectively). This can activate up to 5 damage and healing effects, based on how many Sparks stacks are spent within the same Resonance (this Resonance damage does not inflict more Sparks effects).\\nChange Resonance damage based on the number of foes present, equal to 150%/120%/100% of the original damage if there are 1/2/3+ foes present, respectively.\\nDamage from this Resonance cannot deal Down Point damage. When a foe is defeated, pass its Sparks stacks onto other random foes.": "",
  "Each time a foe receives a <link\\=\"s|194\"><u>Summer Reminiscence</u></link> effect, decrease the foe's Defense by 15% for 3 turns. Stacks up to 3 times.\\nHale Summer Days healing effects apply to all allies.": "",
  "Every 2 times a <link\\=\"s|194\"><u>Summer Reminiscence</u></link> effect is activated, inflict 1 <link\\=\"s|193\"><u>Sparks</u></link> stack on 1 random foe.\\nEach time Sparks is inflicted on a foe, permanently increase party's Attack by 2%. Stacks up to 15 times.": "",
  "Increase the skill levels of Have a Cold Drink and Hale Summer Days by 3.": "",
  "Highlight Enhanced: Deal bonus damage (2 hits) and inflict 1 <link\\=\"s|193\"><u>Sparks</u></link> stack per hit.": "",
  "Increase the skill levels of Sparkling Memories and Thief Tactics by 3.": "",
  "<link\\=\"s|194\"><u>Summer Reminiscence</u></link> gains the following effects.\\nWhen dealing damage with Summer Reminiscence, increase critical rate by 35%. Each time a foe takes a Summer Reminiscence effect, permanently increase damage taken by 5%. This effect stacks up to 3 times. At the maximum stack, increase critical damage taken by 20% more.": "",
  "At the start of battle, gain 4 <link\\=\"s|131\"><u>Greenleaf</u></link> stacks. Stacks up to 5 times. Every 2 actions, gain 1 Greenleaf stack.": "",
  "When Tomoko spends <link\\=\"s|131\"><u>Greenleaf</u></link> stacks, restore HP to the ally with the lowest HP by 15% of Tomoko's Attack.": "",
  "The effect of Self-Renewal now grants 1 <link\\=\"s|131\"><u>Greenleaf</u></link> stack each action.": "",
  "Increase the skill levels of Psyche Melody and Cheering You On by 2.": "",
